abstract: "Saved thermal-control outcomes, numerical and fixed-replay checks, three additional Small initializations, and 64 empirical IID latency Monte Carlo repetitions. All outcomes are retained. There are 24 unique nominal test episodes. Code is MIT; data and research figures are CC BY 4.0."
